**Security-relevant decisions:**
- Deep links resolve ONLY to internal native routes via allowlist map — never WebView with external URL
- Exact hostname allowlist (`app.example.com`), HTTPS only, typed parameter validation (UUID/enum)
- Single resolver handles Universal Links, App Links, and custom schemes identically
- Links never authorize, mutate state, or convey identity/entitlement — screens fetch data via session
- Android: `taskAffinity=""`, `singleTask`, `autoVerify`, handles `onNewIntent` + `onCreate`
